# --- Never commit copyrighted material -------------------------------------
# Users supply their own legal copies of the games and of Kickstart ROMs.

# Kickstart ROM images (Commodore/Cloanto copyright); AROS is not enough for gating.
kickstarts/*
!kickstarts/README.md

# Workbench/OS disk images (Commodore copyright)
os/**/*.adf
os/**/*.ADF

# Floppy images anywhere (copyrighted)
*.adf
*.ADF
*.ipf
*.IPF
*.dms
*.DMS
*.adz
*.ADZ
*.lha
*.LHA
games/**/originals/
games/**/alt/
games/**/disks/
games/**/extracted/

# Anything containing game RAM, data or imagery
**/work/snapshots/
**/work/dumps/
**/work/ref/
**/work/**/*.png
**/work/**/*.bin
**/work/**/*.sav
**/*.png
**/*.sav
**/*.uss
**/*.ussx
**/*.rom

# Build outputs contain patched game files / whole disks
**/build/
games/**/dist/
/dist/*
!/dist/*.sh
!/dist/*.md

# --- Local / generated ------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
**/*.img
**/*.gz
**/*.hlog
**/local_*
a.out
*.o
*.map

# Manuals and scans (copyrighted)
**/*.pdf
**/*.PDF
**/*.wav
**/*.WAV

